 Q1. Install and Configure Apache HBase. Create a Student Table

 Installation and Configuration

Download and extract Apache HBase, then open the HBase configuration file.

File: `conf/hbase-site.xml`

```xml
<configuration>
    <property>
        <name>hbase.rootdir</name>
        <value>file:///tmp/hbase</value>
    </property>
    <property>
        <name>hbase.cluster.distributed</name>
        <value>false</value>
    </property>
</configuration>
```

Start HBase:

```bash
bin/start-hbase.sh
```

Open HBase Shell:

```bash
bin/hbase shell
```

